async function loadEntityFacet(){const el=$('#entityFilter');if(!el)return;const group=entityGroupForCategory($('#category').value),cur=el.value;if(S.entityFacetAbort)S.entityFacetAbort.abort();if(!group){el.disabled=true;el.innerHTML='<option value="">Entidade: escolha Personagem, Item, Monstro, NPC, Mapa ou Efeito</option>';return}const controller=new AbortController();S.entityFacetAbort=controller;try{const d=await api(`/api/entities?group=${encodeURIComponent(group)}&limit=2000`,{signal:controller.signal});if(controller.signal.aborted)return;el.disabled=false;el.innerHTML='<option value="">Todas as entidades relacionadas</option>'+d.items.map(e=>`<option value="${esc(e.entity_key)}">${esc(e.display_name)} (${Number(e.asset_count||0)})</option>`).join('');if([...el.options].some(o=>o.value===cur))el.value=cur;else el.value=''}catch(e){if(e?.name==='AbortError')return;el.disabled=true;el.innerHTML='<option value="">Entidades indisponíveis</option>'}finally{if(S.entityFacetAbort===controller)S.entityFacetAbort=null}}
async function loadSmdPreviewBatch(){if(!$('#smdPreviewBatchState'))return;try{const d=await api('/api/smd-preview-batch'),b=d.batch||{},c=d.index?.counts||b.counts_final||b.counts||{};$('#smdPreviewBatchState').textContent=b.status==='RUNNING'?`RUNNING · ${Number(b.completed||0)}/${Number(b.selected_for_render||0)}`:(b.status||'NOT_RUN');$('#smdPreviewBatchSummary').textContent=`READY ${Number(c.READY||0)} · MISSING ${Number(c.MISSING||0)} · STALE ${Number(c.STALE||0)} · FAILED ${Number(c.FAILED||0)} · UNSUPPORTED ${Number(c.UNSUPPORTED||0)}${b.duration_seconds!=null?' · '+Number(b.duration_seconds).toFixed(1)+'s':''}`;return b}catch(e){$('#smdPreviewBatchState').textContent='Erro';$('#smdPreviewBatchSummary').textContent=e.message;return null}}
async function runSmdPreviewBatch(mode='warmup'){try{const d=await api('/api/smd-preview-batch',{method:'POST',body:{mode,workers:1}});toast('Batch SMD iniciado em background');S.clientJob=d.job?.id||null;clearInterval(S.smdBatchPoll);S.smdBatchPoll=setInterval(async()=>{await loadSmdPreviewBatch();if(!S.clientJob)return;try{const j=(await api('/api/job?id='+encodeURIComponent(S.clientJob))).job;if(!['QUEUED','RUNNING','CANCELLING'].includes(j.status)){clearInterval(S.smdBatchPoll);S.smdBatchPoll=null;await loadSmdPreviewBatch();await loadCatalog();}}catch(e){}},1200);await loadSmdPreviewBatch()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}
async function selectAsset(path){S.selected=path;$$('#assetRows tr').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('selected',x.dataset.path===path));$$('[data-card-path]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('selected',x.dataset.cardPath===path));const seq=++S.assetRequestSeq;try{const d=await api('/api/asset?path='+encodeURIComponent(path));if(seq!==S.assetRequestSeq)return;renderDetail(d.asset)}catch(e){if(seq===S.assetRequestSeq)toast(e.message)}}
